OL,3,GNEWSACalls to change holiday lets
OL,4,Acouncil tax rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA law allowing second homeowners to
OL,7,Fswitch their properties to short-term
OL,8,Fholiday lets and then claim backdated
OL,9,Fcouncil tax refunds should be changed,
OL,10,Fa council has said.
OL,12,FCornwall Council said the practice had
OL,13,Fcost it about #10m so far this
OL,14,Ffinancial year - meaning it could have
OL,15,Fto find savings on its council tax
OL,16,Fsupport scheme for low income
OL,17,Fhouseholds.
OL,19,FHousing campaigners have branded it
OL,20,F"outrageous" and joined calls for
OL,21,Fholiday lets to be classed as second
OL,22,Fhomes so they still pay council tax.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
